<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse turnover falls to HUF 6.047 bln.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse turnover falls to HUF 6.047 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's spot share turnover fell to 6.047 billion forints on Monday from 10.209 billion forints on Friday, according to final figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
